  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  allNames:
  - splenius muscles
  - musculi splenii
  - "muscles spl\xE9nius"
  - "m\xFAsculos del esplenio"
  - "m\xFAsculos espl\xEAnios"
  - muscoli dello splenio
  - splenius spieren
  - milzmuskeln
  - "splenium mi\u0119\u015Bnie"
  - "\u813E\u81DF\u808C\u8089"
  description: "SPLENIUS MUSCLES\r\n\r\n\r\nThe splenius muscles are:\r\n\r\n   
    Splenius capitis muscle\r\n    Splenius cervicis muscle\r\n\r\nTheir origins
    are in the upper thoracic and lower cervical spinous processes. \r\n\r\nTheir
    actions are to extend and ipsilaterally rotate the head and neck.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Splenius_muscles\r\n;;;ES;;;\r\n\n\n\nM\xDASCULOS
    ESPLENOS\n\n\nLos m\xFAsculos esplenios son:\n\n M\xFAsculo esplenio de la cabeza\n
    M\xFAsculo esplenio del cuello uterino\n\nSus or\xEDgenes se encuentran en las
    ap\xF3fisis espinosas tor\xE1cica superior y cervical inferior.\n\nSus acciones
    son extender y rotar ipsolateralmente la cabeza y el cuello.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Splenius_muscles\n\r\n;;;FR;;;\r\n\n\n\nMUSCLES
    SPLENIUS\n\n\nLes muscles spl\xE9niens sont :\n\nMuscle spl\xE9nius de la t\xEAte\nMuscle
    spl\xE9nius du col de l'ut\xE9rus\n\nLeurs origines se trouvent dans les apophyses
    \xE9pineuses thoraciques sup\xE9rieures et cervicales inf\xE9rieures.\n\nLeurs
    actions consistent \xE0 \xE9tendre et \xE0 faire pivoter ipsilat\xE9ralement
    la t\xEAte et le cou.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Splenius_muscles\n\r\n;;;PT;;;\r\n\n\n\nM\xDASCULOS
    ESPL\xCANICOS\n\n\nOs m\xFAsculos espl\xEAnicos s\xE3o:\n\n M\xFAsculo espl\xEAnio
    da cabe\xE7a\n M\xFAsculo espl\xEAnio cervical\n\nSuas origens est\xE3o nos processos
    espinhosos tor\xE1cicos superiores e cervicais inferiores. \n\nSuas a\xE7\xF5es
    s\xE3o estender e girar ipsilateralmente a cabe\xE7a e o pesco\xE7o.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Splenius_muscles\n"
