--- !u!114 &870869500059052168
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 870869500059052180}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 00fda604ac3af404a8e8a7571f24c19d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  allNames:
  - masseteric fascia
  - fascia masseterica
  - "fascia mass\xE9t\xE9rique"
  - fascia masetera
  - "f\xE1scia masset\xE9rica"
  - fascia masseterica
  - masseteric fascia
  - masseterische faszien
  - "powi\u0119\u017A maseteryczna"
  - "\u54AC\u808C\u7B4B\u819C"
  description: "MASSETERIC FASCIA\r\n\r\n\r\nThe masseteric fascia (parotideomasseteric
    fascia) is a strong layer of fascia derived from the deep cervical fascia on
    the human head and neck. \r\n\r\nIt covers the masseter, and is firmly connected
    to it. \r\n\r\nAbove, this fascia is attached to the lower border of the zygomatic
    arch, and behind, it invests the parotid gland proceeding into the parotid fascia.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masseteric_fascia\r\n;;;ES;;;\r\n\n\n\nFASCIA
    MASET\xC9RICA\n\n\nLa fascia maseterina (fascia parotideomasset\xE9rica) es una
    capa fuerte de fascia derivada de la fascia cervical profunda en la cabeza y
    el cuello humanos.\n\nCubre el masetero y est\xE1 firmemente conectado a \xE9l.\n\nPor
    arriba, esta fascia se une al borde inferior del arco cigom\xE1tico, y por detr\xE1s
    reviste la gl\xE1ndula par\xF3tida que contin\xFAa hacia la fascia parot\xEDdea.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masseteric_fascia\n\r\n;;;FR;;;\r\n\n\n\nFASCIA
    MAST\xC9TERIQUE\n\n\nLe fascia mass\xE9t\xE9rique (fascia parotideomass\xE9t\xE9rique)
    est une forte couche de fascia d\xE9riv\xE9e du fascia cervical profond sur la
    t\xEAte et le cou humains.\n\nIl recouvre le mass\xE9ter et y est solidement
    reli\xE9.\n\nAu-dessus, ce fascia est attach\xE9 au bord inf\xE9rieur de l'arcade
    zygomatique, et derri\xE8re, il investit la glande parotide en proc\xE9dant dans
    le fascia parotidien.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maseteric_fascia\n\r\n;;;PT;;;\r\n\n\n\nF\xC1SCIA
    MASSETERICA\n\n\nA f\xE1scia masset\xE9rica (f\xE1scia parotideomasset\xE9rica)
    \xE9 uma forte camada de f\xE1scia derivada da f\xE1scia cervical profunda na
    cabe\xE7a e pesco\xE7o humanos.\n\nEle cobre o masseter e est\xE1 firmemente
    conectado a ele.\n\nAcima, esta f\xE1scia est\xE1 inserida na borda inferior
    do arco zigom\xE1tico e, atr\xE1s, reveste a gl\xE2ndula par\xF3tida, seguindo
    para a f\xE1scia parot\xEDdea.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masseteric_fascia\n"
