    septum\r\n        -Raphe of pelvic diaphragm\r\n        -Anococcygeal ligament\r\n   
    -Pelvic diaphragm\r\n        -Levator ani\r\n        -Urogenital hiatus\r\n       
    -Anorectal hiatus\r\n        -Coccygeus muscle\r\n    -Perineal muscles\r\n       
    -Muscles of urogenital triangle\r\n        -Muscle of anal triangle\r\n           
    -External anal sphincter\r\n;;;ES;;;\r\n\n\n\nM\xDASCULOS DE LA PELVIS\n\n\n-Cuerpo
    perineal\n-tabique posanal\n-Rafe del diafragma p\xE9lvico\n-Ligamento anococc\xEDgeo\n-diafragma
