    urog\xE9nital\n- hiatus anorectal\n-Muscle coccygien\n- Muscles p\xE9rin\xE9aux\n-Muscles
    du triangle urog\xE9nital\n-Muscle du triangle anal\n- Sphincter anal externe\n\r\n;;;PT;;;\r\n\n\n\nM\xDASCULOS
