  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  allNames: []
  description: "TENDON SHEATHS OF LOWER LIMB\r\n\r\n\r\nAnterior tarsal tendon sheaths\r\n
    Tendon sheath of tibialis anterior muscle\r\n Tendon sheath of extensor hallucis
    longus\r\n Tendon sheath of extensor digitorum longus\r\nTibial tarsal tendon
    sheaths\r\n Tendon sheath of flexor digitorum longus\r\n Tendon sheath of tibialis
    posterior muscle\r\n Tendon sheath of flexor hallucis longus\r\nFibular tarsal
    tendon sheaths\r\n Common tendon sheath of fibularis muscles\r\n Plantar tendon
    sheath of fibularis longus muscle\r\nTendon sheaths of toes\r\n Fibrous sheaths
    of toes\r\n  Annular part of fibrous sheath of digit of foot\r\n  Cruciform part
    of fibrous sheath of digit of foot\r\n Synovial sheaths of toes\r\n  Vincula
    tendinum of foot\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://ta2viewer.openanatomy.org/?id=2754\r\n;;;ES;;;\r\n\n\n\nVAINAS
    TENDINAS DE LA EXTREMIDAD INFERIOR\n\n\nVainas tendinosas del tarso anterior\n
    Vaina tendinosa del m\xFAsculo tibial anterior\n Vaina tendinosa del extensor
    hallucis longus\n Vaina tendinosa del extensor largo de los dedos\nVainas tendinosas
    del tarso tibial\n Vaina tendinosa del flexor largo de los dedos\n Vaina tendinosa
    del m\xFAsculo tibial posterior\nVaina tendinosa del flexor largo del dedo gordo\nVainas
    del tend\xF3n del tarso del peron\xE9\nVaina tendinosa com\xFAn de los m\xFAsculos
    fibularis\nVaina del tend\xF3n plantar del m\xFAsculo fibularis longus\nVainas
    tendinosas de los dedos de los pies\nVainas fibrosas de los dedos de los pies\nParte
    anular de la vaina fibrosa del dedo del pie\nPorci\xF3n cruciforme de la vaina
    fibrosa del dedo del pie\nVainas sinoviales de los dedos de los pies\nVincula
    tendinum del pie\n \n\n\nhttps://ta2viewer.openanatomy.org/?id=2754\n\r\n;;;FR;;;\r\n\n\n\nGAINES
    TENDONIENNES DU MEMBRE INF\xC9RIEUR\n\n\nGaines du tendon tarsien ant\xE9rieur\nGaine
    tendineuse du muscle tibial ant\xE9rieur\nGaine tendineuse du long extenseur
    de l'hallux\nGaine tendineuse du long extenseur des orteils\nGaines du tendon
    du tarse tibial\nGaine tendineuse du long fl\xE9chisseur des doigts\nGaine tendineuse
    du muscle tibial post\xE9rieur\nGaine tendineuse du long fl\xE9chisseur de l'hallux\nGaines
    du tendon du tarse fibulaire\nGaine tendineuse commune des muscles fibulaires\nGaine
    du tendon plantaire du muscle long fibulaire\nGaines tendineuses des orteils\nGaines
    fibreuses des orteils\nPartie annulaire de la gaine fibreuse du doigt du pied\nPartie
    cruciforme de la gaine fibreuse du doigt du pied\nGaines synoviales des orteils\nTendinum
    de Vincula du pied\n \n\n\nhttps://ta2viewer.openanatomy.org/?id=2754\n\r\n;;;PT;;;\r\n\n\n\nBAINHAS
    DO TEND\xC3O DO MEMBRO INFERIOR\n\n\nBainhas do tend\xE3o do tarso anterior\nBainha
    do tend\xE3o do m\xFAsculo tibial anterior\nBainha do tend\xE3o do extensor longo
    do h\xE1lux\nBainha do tend\xE3o do extensor longo dos dedos\nBainhas do tend\xE3o
    tibial tarsal\nBainha do tend\xE3o do flexor longo dos dedos\nBainha do tend\xE3o
    do m\xFAsculo tibial posterior\nBainha do tend\xE3o do flexor longo do h\xE1lux\nBainhas
    do tend\xE3o fibular do tarso\nBainha do tend\xE3o comum dos m\xFAsculos fibulares\nBainha
    do tend\xE3o plantar do m\xFAsculo fibular longo\nBainhas dos tend\xF5es dos
    dedos dos p\xE9s\nBainhas fibrosas dos dedos\nParte anular da bainha fibrosa
    do dedo do p\xE9\nParte cruciforme da bainha fibrosa do dedo do p\xE9\nBainhas
    sinoviais dos dedos\nV\xEDncula tend\xEDnea do p\xE9\n \n\n\nhttps://ta2viewer.openanatomy.org/?id=2754\n"
