--- !u!114 &2839643628148347120
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2839643628148347132}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 00fda604ac3af404a8e8a7571f24c19d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  allNames:
  - levator anguli oris
  - levator anguli oris
  - "muscle \xE9l\xE9vateur de l'angle de la bouche"
  - levator anguli oris
  - "levantador do \xE2ngulo da boca"
  - levator anguli oris
  - levator anguli oris
  - levator anguli oris
  - "d\u017Awigacz k\u0105towy oris"
  - "\u53E3\u89D2\u63D0\u808C"
  description: "LEVATOR ANGULI ORIS\r\n\r\n\r\nThe levator anguli oris (caninus)
    is a facial muscle of the mouth arising from the canine fossa, immediately below
    the infraorbital foramen. It elevates angle of mouth medially. Its fibers are
    inserted into the angle of the mouth, intermingling with those of the zygomaticus,
    triangularis, and orbicularis oris. Specifically, the levator anguli oris is
    innervated by the buccal branches of the facial nerve.\r\n\r\n\r\n== Additional
    images ==\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\n\r\n== References ==\r\n This article incorporates
    text in the public domain from page 383 of the 20th edition of Gray's Anatomy
    (1918)\r\n\r\n\r\n== External links ==\r\nPTCentral\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Levator_anguli_oris\r\n;;;ES;;;\r\n\n\n\n\nELEVATOR
    ANGULI ORIS\n\n\nEl elevador del \xE1ngulo de la boca (canino) es un m\xFAsculo
    facial de la boca que surge de la fosa canina, inmediatamente debajo del agujero
    infraorbitario. Eleva medialmente el \xE1ngulo de la boca. Sus fibras se insertan
    en el \xE1ngulo de la boca, entremezcl\xE1ndose con las del zygomaticus, triangularis
    y orbicularis oris. Espec\xEDficamente, el elevador del \xE1ngulo de la boca
    est\xE1 inervado por las ramas bucales del nervio facial.\n\n\n== Im\xE1genes
    adicionales ==\n\n \n\n\n== Referencias ==\n Este art\xEDculo incorpora texto
    de dominio p\xFAblico de la p\xE1gina 383 de la 20.\xAA edici\xF3n de Grey's
    Anatomy (1918)\n\n\n== Enlaces externos ==\nPTCentral\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Levator_anguli_oris\n\r\n;;;FR;;;\r\n\n\n\n\nASCENSEUR
    ANGULI ORIS\n\n\nLe levator anguli oris (caninus) est un muscle facial de la
    bouche naissant de la fosse canine, juste en dessous du foramen sous-orbitaire.
    Il \xE9l\xE8ve l'angle de la bouche m\xE9dialement. Ses fibres s'ins\xE8rent
    dans l'angle de la bouche, se m\xEAlant \xE0 celles du zygomaticus, du triangularis
    et de l'orbicularis oris. Plus pr\xE9cis\xE9ment, le levator anguli oris est
    innerv\xE9 par les branches buccales du nerf facial.\n\n\n== Images suppl\xE9mentaires
    ==\n\n \n\n\n== R\xE9f\xE9rences ==\nCet article incorpore du texte dans le domaine
    public de la page 383 de la 20e \xE9dition de Gray's Anatomy (1918)\n\n\n== Liens
    externes ==\nPTCentral\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Levator_anguli_oris\n\r\n;;;PT;;;\r\n\n\n\n\nLEVADOR
    ANGULI ORIS\n\n\nO levantador do \xE2ngulo da boca (canino) \xE9 um m\xFAsculo
    facial da boca que se origina da fossa canina, imediatamente abaixo do forame
    infraorbit\xE1rio. Eleva o \xE2ngulo da boca medialmente. Suas fibras s\xE3o
    inseridas no \xE2ngulo da boca, misturando-se com as do zigom\xE1tico, triangular
    e orbicular da boca. Especificamente, o elevador do \xE2ngulo da boca \xE9 inervado
    pelos ramos bucais do nervo facial.\n\n\n== Imagens adicionais ==\n\n \n\n\n==
    Refer\xEAncias ==\nEste artigo incorpora o texto de dom\xEDnio p\xFAblico da
    p\xE1gina 383 da 20\xAA edi\xE7\xE3o de Gray's Anatomy (1918)\n\n\n== Links externos
    ==\nPTCentral\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Levator_anguli_oris\n"
