  - "\u4E09\u89D2\u808C\u7B4B\u819C"
  description: "DELTOID FASCIA\r\n\r\n\r\nThe deltoid fascia contributes to the brachial
    fascia and is connected to the medial and lateral intermuscular septa.\r\n;;;ES;;;\r\n\n\n\nFASCIA
    DELTOIDES\n\n\nLa fascia deltoidea contribuye a la fascia braquial y est\xE1
    conectada a los tabiques intermusculares medial y lateral.\n\r\n;;;FR;;;\r\n\n\n\nFASCIA
    DELTO\xCFDE\n\n\nLe fascia delto\xEFde contribue au fascia brachial et est reli\xE9
    aux septa intermusculaires m\xE9dial et lat\xE9ral.\n\r\n;;;PT;;;\r\n\n\n\nF\xC1SCIA
    DELT\xD3IDE\n\n\nA f\xE1scia delt\xF3ide contribui para a f\xE1scia braquial
    e est\xE1 conectada aos septos intermusculares medial e lateral.\n"
