  allNames:
  - dorsal interossei muscles of hand
  - musculi interossei dorsales manus
  - muscles interosseux dorsaux de la main
  - "m\xFAsculos inter\xF3seos dorsales de la mano"
  - "m\xFAsculos inter\xF3sseos dorsais da m\xE3o"
  - muscoli interossei dorsali della mano
  - dorsale interossei spieren van de hand
