  - "\u817F\u90E8\u5916\u5074\u9694\u9593"
  description: "LATERAL COMPARTMENT OF LEG\r\n\r\n\r\n== Muscles ==\r\n\r\nThe lateral
    compartment of the leg contains:\r\n\r\n-Fibularis longus\r\n-Fibularis brevis\r\n\r\n\r\n==
    Action ==\r\n\r\nFoot evertors\r\nFoot plantarflexion\r\n\r\n\r\n== Nerve Supply
    ==\r\n\r\nThe lateral compartment of the leg is supplied by the superficial fibular
    nerve (superficial peroneal nerve).\r\n\r\n\r\n== Blood Supply ==\r\n\r\nIts
    proximal and distal arterial supply consists of perforating branches of the anterial
    tibial artery and fibular artery.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lateral_compartment_of_leg\r\n;;;ES;;;\r\n\n\n\nCOMPARTIMENTO
    LATERAL DE LA PIERNA\n\n\n== M\xFAsculos ==\n\nEl compartimento lateral de la
    pierna contiene:\n\n-Peron\xE9 largo\n-Peron\xE9 corto\n\n\n== Acci\xF3n ==\n\nEvertores
    del pie\nFlexi\xF3n plantar del pie\n\n\n== Suministro nervioso ==\n\nEl compartimiento
    lateral de la pierna est\xE1 inervado por el nervio fibular superficial (nervio
    peroneo superficial).\n\n\n== Suministro de sangre ==\n\nSu irrigaci\xF3n arterial
    proximal y distal consiste en ramas perforantes de la arteria tibial anterior
    y la arteria fibular.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lateral_compartment_of_leg\n\r\n;;;FR;;;\r\n\n\n\nCOMPARTIMENT
    LATERAL DE JAMBE\n\n\n== Muscles ==\n\nLe compartiment lat\xE9ral de la jambe
    contient :\n\n-Longue fibulaire\n- Court fibulaire\n\n\n== Action ==\n\n\xC9ventreurs
    de pied\nFlexion plantaire du pied\n\n\n== Alimentation nerveuse ==\n\nLe compartiment
    lat\xE9ral de la jambe est aliment\xE9 par le nerf fibulaire superficiel (nerf
    p\xE9ronier superficiel).\n\n\n== Approvisionnement en sang ==\n\nSon apport
    art\xE9riel proximal et distal est constitu\xE9 de branches perforantes de l'art\xE8re
    tibiale ant\xE9rieure et de l'art\xE8re fibulaire.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lateral_compartment_of_leg\n\r\n;;;PT;;;\r\n\n\n\nCOMPARTIMENTO
    LATERAL DA PERNA\n\n\n== M\xFAsculos ==\n\nO compartimento lateral da perna cont\xE9m:\n\n-Fibular
    longo\n-Fibular curto\n\n\n== A\xE7\xE3o ==\n\nP\xE9s eversores\nFlex\xE3o plantar
    do p\xE9\n\n\n== Suprimento Nervoso ==\n\nO compartimento lateral da perna \xE9
    suprido pelo nervo fibular superficial (nervo fibular superficial).\n\n\n== Suprimento
    Sangu\xEDneo ==\n\nSeu suprimento arterial proximal e distal consiste em ramos
    perfurantes da art\xE9ria tibial anterior e da art\xE9ria fibular.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lateral_compartment_of_leg\n"
