--- !u!114 &7618611581047594152
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7618611581047594164}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 00fda604ac3af404a8e8a7571f24c19d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  allNames:
  - innermost intercostal muscles
  - musculi intercostales intimi
  - muscle intercostal intime
  - "m\xFAsculos intercostales m\xE1s internos"
  - "m\xFAsculos intercostais \xEDntimos"
  - "muscoli intercostali pi\xF9 interni"
  - binnenste intercostale spieren
  - innerste interkostalmuskeln
  - "najg\u0142\u0119bsze mi\u0119\u015Bnie mi\u0119dzy\u017Cebrowe"
  - "\u6700\u5167\u5074\u7684\u808B\u9593\u808C"
  description: "INNERMOST INTERCOSTAL MUSCLE(S)\r\n\r\n\r\nThe innermost intercostal
    muscle is a layer of intercostal muscles. \r\n\r\nIt may also be called the intima
    of the internal intercostal muscles. \r\n\r\nIt is the deepest muscular layer
    of the thorax, with muscle fibres running vertically (in parallel with the internal
    intercostal muscles). \r\n\r\nIt is present only in the middle of each intercostal
    space, and often not present higher up the rib cage. \r\n\r\nIt lies deep to
    the plane that contains the intercostal nerves and intercostal vessels, and the
    internal intercostal muscles. \r\n\r\nThe diaphragm is continuous with the innermost
    intercostal muscle.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Innermost_intercostal_muscle\r\n;;;ES;;;\r\n\n\n\nM\xDASCULO(S)
    INTERCOSTAL(ES) M\xC1S INTERNO(S)\n\n\nEl m\xFAsculo intercostal m\xE1s interno
    es una capa de m\xFAsculos intercostales. \n\nTambi\xE9n puede llamarse la \xEDntima
    de los m\xFAsculos intercostales internos. \n\nEs la capa muscular m\xE1s profunda
    del t\xF3rax, con fibras musculares que corren verticalmente (en paralelo con
    los m\xFAsculos intercostales internos). \n\nEst\xE1 presente solo en el medio
    de cada espacio intercostal y, a menudo, no est\xE1 presente en la parte superior
    de la caja tor\xE1cica. \n\nSe encuentra por debajo del plano que contiene los
    nervios intercostales y los vasos intercostales, y los m\xFAsculos intercostales
    internos. \n\nEl diafragma se contin\xFAa con el m\xFAsculo intercostal m\xE1s
    interno.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Innermost_intercostal_muscle\n\r\n;;;FR;;;\r\n\n\n\nMUSCLE(S)
    INTERCOSTAL(S) LE PLUS INTERNE\n\n\nLe muscle intercostal le plus interne est
    une couche de muscles intercostaux. \n\nIl peut \xE9galement \xEAtre appel\xE9
    l'intima des muscles intercostaux internes.\n\nC'est la couche musculaire la
    plus profonde du thorax, avec des fibres musculaires s'\xE9tendant verticalement
    (parall\xE8lement aux muscles intercostaux internes).\n\nIl n'est pr\xE9sent
    qu'au milieu de chaque espace intercostal et souvent absent plus haut dans la
    cage thoracique.\n\nIl se situe profond\xE9ment dans le plan qui contient les
    nerfs intercostaux et les vaisseaux intercostaux, ainsi que les muscles intercostaux
    internes.\n\nLe diaphragme est en continuit\xE9 avec le muscle intercostal le
    plus interne.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Innermost_intercostal_muscle\n\r\n;;;PT;;;\r\n\n\n\nM\xDASCULO(S)
    INTERCOSTAL(S) INTERNO(S)\n\n\nO m\xFAsculo intercostal mais interno \xE9 uma
    camada de m\xFAsculos intercostais.\n\nTamb\xE9m pode ser chamado de \xEDntima
    dos m\xFAsculos intercostais internos.\n\n\xC9 a camada muscular mais profunda
    do t\xF3rax, com fibras musculares correndo verticalmente (em paralelo com os
    m\xFAsculos intercostais internos).\n\nEst\xE1 presente apenas no meio de cada
    espa\xE7o intercostal e, muitas vezes, n\xE3o est\xE1 presente na parte superior
    da caixa tor\xE1cica.\n\nSitua-se profundamente ao plano que cont\xE9m os nervos
    intercostais e vasos intercostais e os m\xFAsculos intercostais internos.\n\nO
    diafragma \xE9 cont\xEDnuo com o m\xFAsculo intercostal mais interno.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Innermost_intercostal_muscle\n"
