  allNames:
  - fasciae of thorax
  - fasciae thoracis
  - fascias du thorax
  - "fascia del t\xF3rax"
  - "f\xE1scia do t\xF3rax"
  - fascie del torace
  - fasciae van thorax
  - faszien des thorax
  - "powi\u0119zi klatki piersiowej"
  - "\u80F8\u7B4B\u819C"
  description: "FASCIAE OF THORAX\r\n\r\n\r\n    -Pectoral fascia\r\n    -Clavipectoral
    fascia\r\n        -Costocoracoid ligament\r\n        -Costocoracoid membrane\r\n       
    -Suspensory ligament of axilla\r\n   \r\n    -Thoracic fascia\r\n    -Endothoracic
    fascia\r\n        -Suprapleural membrane\r\n        -Phrenicopleural fascia\r\n           
    -Superior phrenico-oesophageal ligament\r\n;;;ES;;;\r\n\n\n\nFASCIA DEL T\xD3RAX\n\n\n-Fascia
    pectoral\n-Fascia clavipectoral\n-Ligamento costocoracoideo\n-Membrana costocoracoide\n-Ligamento
    suspensorio de la axila.\n \n-Fascia tor\xE1cica\n-Fascia endotor\xE1cica\n-Membrana
    suprapleural\n-Fascia frenopleural\n-Ligamento fr\xE9nico-esof\xE1gico superior\n\r\n;;;FR;;;\r\n\n\n\nFASCIA
    DU THORAX\n\n\n-Fascia pectoral\n-Fascia clavipectoral\n-Ligament costocoraco\xEFde\n-Membrane
    costocoraco\xEFde\n- Ligament suspenseur de l'aisselle\n \n- Fascia thoracique\n-Fascia
    endothoracique\n-Membrane supra-pleurale\n- Fascia phr\xE9nicopleural\n -Ligament
    phrenico-oesophagien sup\xE9rieur\n\r\n;;;PT;;;\r\n\n\n\nF\xC1SCIA DO T\xD3RAX\n\n\n-
    F\xE1scia peitoral\n-F\xE1scia clavipeitoral\n- Ligamento costocorac\xF3ide\n-Membrana
    costocorac\xF3ide\n- Ligamento suspensor da axila\n \n- F\xE1scia Tor\xE1cica\n-
    F\xE1scia endotor\xE1cica\n-Membrana suprapleural\n-F\xE1scia frenicopleural\n
    - Ligamento frenico-esof\xE1gico superior\n"
