--- !u!114 &7831500303398816674
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7831500303398816684}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 00fda604ac3af404a8e8a7571f24c19d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  allNames:
  - tendon sheaths
  - vaginae tendinum
  - gaine tendineuse
  - vainas de tendones
  - "bainhas de tend\xE3o"
  - guaine tendinee
  - peesmantels
  - sehnenscheiden
  - "pochewki \u015Bci\u0119gien"
  - "\u8171\u9798"
  description: "TENDON SHEATH\r\n\r\n\r\nA tendon sheath is a layer of synovial membrane
    around a tendon. \r\n\r\nIt permits the tendon to stretch and not adhere to the
    surrounding fascia.\r\nIt has two layers: \r\n\r\nsynovial sheath\r\nfibrous
    tendon sheathFibroma of the tendon sheath has been described.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tendon_sheath\r\n;;;ES;;;\r\n\n\n\nVAINA
    DEL TEND\xD3N\n\n\nUna vaina de tend\xF3n es una capa de membrana sinovial alrededor
    de un tend\xF3n. \n\nPermite que el tend\xF3n se estire y no se adhiera a la
    fascia circundante.\nTiene dos capas: \n\nvaina sinovial\nvaina tendinosa fibrosa
    Se ha descrito el fibroma de la vaina tendinosa.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tendon_sheath\n\r\n;;;FR;;;\r\n\n\n\nGAINE
    TENDONIENNE\n\n\nUne gaine tendineuse est une couche de membrane synoviale entourant
    un tendon.\n\nIl permet au tendon de s'\xE9tirer et de ne pas adh\xE9rer au fascia
    environnant.\nIl a deux couches :\n\ngaine synoviale\ngaine fibreuse du tendon
    Un fibrome de la gaine du tendon a \xE9t\xE9 d\xE9crit.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tendon_gaine\n\r\n;;;PT;;;\r\n\n\n\nBAINHA
    DO TEND\xC3O\n\n\nUma bainha de tend\xE3o \xE9 uma camada de membrana sinovial
    ao redor de um tend\xE3o.\n\nEle permite que o tend\xE3o se estique e n\xE3o
    adira \xE0 f\xE1scia circundante.\nPossui duas camadas:\n\nbainha sinovial\nbainha
    do tend\xE3o fibrosoFibroma da bainha do tend\xE3o foi descrito.\n\n\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tendon_sheath\n"
