  - muskeln des brustkorbs
  - "mi\u0119\u015Bnie klatki piersiowej"
  - "\u80F8\u90E8\u808C\u8089"
  description: "MUSCLES OF THORAX\r\n\r\n\r\n    -Sternalis muscle\r\n    -Pectoralis
    major muscle\r\n    -Pectoralis minor muscle\r\n    -Subclavius muscle\r\n   
    -Serratus anterior muscle\r\n    -Levatores costarum\r\n    -External intercostal
    muscles\r\n    -Internal intercostal muscles\r\n    -Innermost intercostal muscles\r\n   
    -Subcostal muscles\r\n    -Transversus thoracis muscle\r\n;;;ES;;;\r\n\n\n\nM\xDASCULOS
    DEL T\xD3RAX\n\n\n-M\xFAsculo esternal\n-M\xFAsculo pectoral mayor\n-M\xFAsculo
    pectoral menor\n-M\xFAsculo subclavio\n-M\xFAsculo serrato anterior\n-Levatores
    costarum\n-M\xFAsculos intercostales externos\n-M\xFAsculos intercostales internos\n-M\xFAsculos
    intercostales m\xE1s internos\n-M\xFAsculos subcostales\n-M\xFAsculo transverso
    del t\xF3rax\n\r\n;;;FR;;;\r\n\n\n\nMUSCLES DU THORAX\n\n\n-Muscle sternal\n-Muscle
    grand pectoral\n-Muscle petit pectoral\n-Muscle sous-clavier\n-Muscle dentel\xE9
    ant\xE9rieur\n-Levatores costarum\n-Muscles intercostaux externes\n-Muscles intercostaux
    internes\n-Muscles intercostaux les plus internes\n-Muscles sous-costaux\n-Muscle
    transverse du thorax\n\r\n;;;PT;;;\r\n\n\n\nM\xDASCULOS DO T\xD3RAX\n\n\n -M\xFAsculo
    esternal\n -M\xFAsculo peitoral maior\n -M\xFAsculo peitoral menor\n -M\xFAsculo
    subcl\xE1vio\n -M\xFAsculo serr\xE1til anterior\n -Levatores costarum\n -M\xFAsculos
    intercostais externos\n -M\xFAsculos intercostais internos\n -M\xFAsculos intercostais
    internos\n -M\xFAsculos subcostais\n -M\xFAsculo transverso do t\xF3rax\n"
